      "revision": 1298609979,
      "text": "Ancistrocladus tectorius is a species of flowering plant in the monogeneric family Ancistrocladaceae. It is found in China (Hainan), Cambodia, India, Indonesia, Laos, Malaysia, Myanmar, Singapore, Thailand, and Vietnam. The Vietnamese name is trung quân lợp nhà; Chinese: 钩枝藤, gou zhi teng."
